      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Code Review — Error Handler\n\nAssigned as the error workflow of **AI GitHub Code Review System**. On any failure it records a row in `code_review_log` with `status=error`, the execution id, and the failing node + message.\n\n**Extend:** add Slack / Email / Telegram nodes after **Log Failure** to alert your team on failures.",
